  <p>1- Haye minhal bayan kaise karun wo manzer,<br> ek rassi me bandhe bara gale the kas ker *2<br> Sabse chhoti thi behen meri giraftaron me<br> Jab hame laya gaya khaichte bazaaron me *2</p> 
